// BMP binary - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

# A real uncompressed 24-bit BMP whose pixel data is "Hello World!".
# The pixel array is padded to a 4-byte boundary, hence the trailing 00.
0000  42 4D 46 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 42 00 00 00 28 00 |BMF.......B...(.|
0010  00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 18 00 00 00 |................|
0020  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|
0030  00 00 00 00 00 00 48 65 6C 6C 6F 20 57 6F 72 6C |......Hello Worl|
0040  64 21                                           |d!|
